+- [ ] **Step 3: Implement the exact frozen codec**
+
+Implement a big-endian 32-bit body `row[10] || message_id[22]`, a two-byte `HMAC-SHA3-256(key, b"NISHAN-PHYSICAL-MESSAGE/v1\0" + context + body)[:2]`, and twelve independently encoded extended-Hamming blocks. Use code positions `[p1,p2,d0,p4,d1,d2,d3,p0]` and brute-force nearest-codeword decoding; accept a block only at distance 0 or 1. `accepted_expected` requires zero uncorrectable blocks, a valid 16-bit check, and exact equality of both parsed fields to the expected tuple.
